# All sql/ files are now linted — sqlfluff's `databricks` dialect (configured in
# pyproject.toml) parses Databricks/Delta-exclusive syntax (OPTIMIZE ... ZORDER,
# WHEN NOT MATCHED BY SOURCE, column DEFAULT, etc). The handful of constructs its
# grammar still can't parse (COPY INTO, CLONE ... VERSION AS OF, TABLESAMPLE ...
# REPEATABLE(seed), DESCRIBE DETAIL as a subquery source) are suppressed inline
# with `-- noqa: PRS` at the specific statement so the rest of each file is still
# linted normally.
